    "detailed_description": "<strong>Aeons Past</strong><br><br>The first game by Frostwater Media, Aeons Past is a short, 5-8 hour, fantasy RPG.<br><br><strong>Intuitive Exploration!</strong><br><br>Be sure to poke around every corner and crevasse, you never know what you could find to give your party the upper hand!<br><br><br><strong>Dynamic Combat!</strong><br><br>Use powerful spells and abilities to control the flow of combat, and customize your skills to best suite your playstyle!<br><br><br><br><strong>Influence your party through dialogue choices!</strong><br><br>Different dialogue effects how your party reacts! Make sure you say the right things if you want them to like you!<br><br> <br><br><br><br><strong>Activate Powerful Armor Set Bonuses!</strong><br><br>Loot, buy and earn different sets of armor to equip the best set for your character and build!<br><br><br><br><br><strong>A world that shows not tells!</strong><br><br>As much as I like waiting through 15 minute scenes at the beginning of a game, sometimes I like to get straight to the action! With Aeons Past, the gameplay starts almost as soon as you press play!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Aeons Past</strong><br><br>The first game by Frostwater Media, Aeons Past is a short, 5-8 hour, fantasy RPG.<br><br><strong>Intuitive Exploration!</strong><br><br>Be sure to poke around every corner and crevasse, you never know what you could find to give your party the upper hand!<br><br><br><strong>Dynamic Combat!</strong><br><br>Use powerful spells and abilities to control the flow of combat, and customize your skills to best suite your playstyle!<br><br><br><br><strong>Influence your party through dialogue choices!</strong><br><br>Different dialogue effects how your party reacts! Make sure you say the right things if you want them to like you!<br><br> <br><br><br><br><strong>Activate Powerful Armor Set Bonuses!</strong><br><br>Loot, buy and earn different sets of armor to equip the best set for your character and build!<br><br><br><br><br><strong>A world that shows not tells!</strong><br><br>As much as I like waiting through 15 minute scenes at the beginning of a game, sometimes I like to get straight to the action! With Aeons Past, the gameplay starts almost as soon as you press play!",
    "short_description": "Aeons Past is a 3D Turn-Based RPG with heavy emphasis on rewarding exploration, getting immersed in a story-rich narrative, and deep characterization.",
